# Never commit anything resembling a credential or personal study data.
# Keys live in the macOS Keychain and the database lives in
# ~/Library/Application Support — neither should ever appear here, but these
# patterns make an accident impossible rather than unlikely.
*.pem
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
retain-export*.json
